# 5.2's bench (research §29): each rule on CardDemo against test/katana/intent/carddemo.key, within its scope.
# `rule NAME vVERSION facts F true T key K precision P recall R`, then each fact the key does not hold (`not`) and
# each the key holds that the rule missed (`missed`). Written by `gradle integration -Dkatana.record=true`; a lower score is refused.
rule flag.yes-no v1 facts 69 true 68 key 79 precision 0.986 recall 0.861
  not flag COCRDLIC WS-INFO-MSG
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-ACCOUNT-MASTER-READ-FLAG
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-CUST-MASTER-READ-FLAG
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-EDIT-OPEN-DATE-FLGS
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-EDIT-PHONE-NUM-1-FLGS
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-EDIT-PHONE-NUM-2-FLGS
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-EDIT-REISSUE-DATE-FLGS
  missed flag COACTUPC WS-EXPIRY-DATE-FLGS
  missed flag COACTVWC WS-ACCOUNT-MASTER-READ-FLAG
  missed flag COACTVWC WS-CUST-MASTER-READ-FLAG
  missed flag COCRDLIC WS-CA-LAST-PAGE-DISPLAYED
  missed flag COCRDLIC WS-ROW-CRDSELECT-ERROR
rule enum.disjoint-88s v2 facts 118 true 110 key 113 precision 0.932 recall 0.973
  not enum CBSTM03A HTML-FIXED-LN
  not enum COACTUPC WS-EDIT-DATE-CC-N
  not enum COACTUPC WS-INFO-MSG
  not enum COACTVWC WS-INFO-MSG
  not enum COCRDLIC WS-CA-LAST-PAGE-DISPLAYED
  not enum COCRDLIC WS-ERROR-MSG
  not enum COCRDSLC WS-INFO-MSG
  not enum COCRDUPC WS-INFO-MSG
  missed enum COACTUPC ACUP-CHANGE-ACTION
  missed enum COCRDLIC WS-EDIT-SELECT
  missed enum COCRDUPC CCUP-CHANGE-ACTION
